    "desiredFields": {
      "content_zh": "<p>FLASH CAST 为吉隆坡、雪兰莪与巴生谷的零售店、餐饮营业空间、诊所前区、美容或理发门店、展厅及服务门店讨论店铺装修与商业 fit-out。先确认营业用途、租约交付条件和现场限制，再划分顾客动线、展示或服务区、柜台及后场范围。</p><h2>零售店、便利店与展厅</h2><p>把入口、展示、选购、排队、收银与补货路径一起规划。先提供商品或展品尺寸、库存和设备清单，再核对展示柜、收纳、灯光、插座、搬运和维护需要；不以同一装修套餐套用所有店型。</p><h2>餐厅、咖啡店与服务门店</h2><p>餐饮空间应先分开顾客区、服务柜台、备餐与后场动线，核对现有给排水、电气和排风条件。诊所前区、美容或理发门店可先讨论接待、候客、服务区与收纳；专业设备、卫生或行业许可及专业签署需另行核实，不视为装修范围自动包含。</p><h2>Shoplot、商场单位与租约还原</h2><p>说明是空铺首次装修、旧店翻新、局部升级还是租约退场还原。把业主或商场指南、原状交付清单、允许施工时段、运输、电梯、保护及清运要求列入范围；如希望分阶段施工，先确认可隔离的区域和营业影响，再商定安排。</p><h2>开业时间与报价准备</h2><p>提供地点、面积或平面图、现场照片、设备及展示需求、租约交付状态、管理方要求和预期开业时间。报价需分开拆除、墙地面、柜体、灯光、机电衔接、保护、清运及待核实项目；材料供货、审批和现场出入都会影响进度，不能仅按面积或统一工期判断。</p><h2>按主要需求继续了解</h2><p>办公室工位与隔间可查看 <a href=\"/zh/services/office-renovation\">办公室装修服务</a>；展示柜、接待柜台与整体收纳可查看 <a href=\"/zh/services/builtin\">全屋定制与定制家具</a>。需要先梳理平面和材料时，可查看 <a href=\"/zh/services/design\">室内设计与装修规划</a>。准备好照片、地点和重点需求后，<a href=\"/zh/quote\">申请免费装修报价</a>；最终规格、费用、提交责任与施工安排以现场核对和书面范围为准。</p>",
      "content_en": "<p>FLASH CAST discusses shop renovation and commercial fit-out for retail stores, F&B premises, clinic front areas, beauty and hair salons, showrooms and service outlets in Kuala Lumpur, Selangor and the Klang Valley. Business use, tenancy handover conditions and site constraints guide the customer route, display or service zones, counter and back-of-house scope.</p><h2>Retail stores, convenience shops and showrooms</h2><p>Plan entry, displays, browsing, queues, checkout and restocking together. Share product or exhibit dimensions, stock and equipment lists before checking display cabinets, storage, lighting, power points, delivery and maintenance. One fit-out package will not suit every store type.</p><h2>Restaurants, cafes and service outlets</h2><p>Separate customer seating, service counters, preparation and back-of-house movement, then check existing plumbing, electrical and ventilation conditions. Clinic front areas and salons can start with reception, waiting, service zones and storage. Specialist equipment, hygiene or industry licences and professional sign-off require separate checks and are not automatically included.</p><h2>Shoplots, mall units and tenancy reinstatement</h2><p>Clarify whether the work is a first fit-out, older-shop renovation, partial upgrade or end-of-tenancy reinstatement. Include landlord or mall guidelines, the handover inventory, permitted work hours, delivery, lift access, protection and waste removal. For phased work, first identify areas that can be separated and the effect on trading before agreeing the arrangement.</p><h2>Opening dates and quotation preparation</h2><p>Share the location, floor area or plan, photos, equipment and display needs, tenancy condition, management requirements and intended opening date. Separate demolition, finishes, cabinetry, lighting, service coordination, protection, waste removal and items still to be checked. Materials, approvals and access affect the programme; area alone or a fixed generic duration is not enough.</p><h2>Follow the main project need</h2><p>For workstations and partitions, see <a href=\"/en/services/office-renovation\">office renovation</a>. For display cabinets, reception counters and coordinated storage, see <a href=\"/en/services/builtin\">whole-house custom furniture and built-ins</a>. If layout and material choices need clarification first, see <a href=\"/en/services/design\">interior design and renovation planning</a>. Share photos, location and the main requirements to <a href=\"/en/quote\">request a free renovation quotation</a>. Specifications, cost, submission responsibilities and scheduling follow site checks and the written scope.</p>"
    },
